</office:automatic-styles><office:body><office:text><text:p text:style-name="Title">Harbour Newsletter</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Byline">Three columns of synthetic notes for reading-order tests</text:p><text:section text:style-name="Cols3" text:name="N1"><text:p text:style-name="Body">Note N1. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">Note N2. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">Note N3. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">Note N4. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">Note N5. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">Note N6. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">Note N7. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">Note N8. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">Note N9. The survey team walked the line at low tide, noting the plants, the soil and the water in each plot before the tide returned to cover the flats again.</text:p></text:section></office:text></office:body></office:document>
